              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibeoni, ka ilmaani lama qabu, ta Ayafi Ana jed'ani. Anani abba Dishoni, Dishonini nama balbalti gosa Hamranitifi Eshbanitifi Ethranitifi Kerani iraa baate. Eseri, ka balbalti gosa Bilhanitifi Zaawamtifi Yakani iraa baate. Dishaanini nama balbalti gosa Usifi Arani iraa baate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
